{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_040_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2bb98da13faae362077699fbe0c0cf7c4a6a354ef96226483d518ce398980fed",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_23:5_01_040_23_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5219326f4b7664ac63c571d069b2625d65784e0bee666dd551feafceab819aa5",
      "text": "喂，你。\n刚才那巧克力，再多拿点过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_23:5_01_040_23_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a56e58fbf5a47daa40d7c96cc49b3d8382b8bec50ba8acd80b6be66c2a3d46d",
      "text": "就那么一丁点本大爷可满足不了啊。\n动作快点！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_23:5_01_040_23_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae221d6a7638a5be6c93cb1be3183c1e42d3d54dffd2cbf1bad0a9c5f4d04393",
      "text": "我就料到你会这么说，再来一份已经准备好了！\n请慢用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_23:5_01_040_23_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:932f6fe9d686a21c095da54b26e896516a3f6430067a67d3971995687fa4ad0b",
      "text": "什么嘛，这不是还有嘛。\n从一开始就痛快拿出来啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_23:5_01_040_23_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64ca37d9686e0978ce4455473a2f29dd89b35b7f0f82b5f081743e1e57eae703",
      "text": "嚼嚼……嗯？\n跟刚才那个味道不一样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_23:5_01_040_23_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56280f20dcf8bd431eef7ba7a29178bb40454e509e5fd1975c1e84356fa10385",
      "text": "我想着如果能享受到各种各样的口味会更好，\n所以准备了不同的款式哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_23:5_01_040_23_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27da4a9f47ee1de65126de9e3e8a6121915bf193ced5fe152123dfd135f4d478",
      "text": "哼。态度还挺值得嘉许的嘛。\n你这家伙也开始懂点事了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_23:5_01_040_23_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e8e87795b70af40215086c7ea37ec949eb437e69c15e7d1dbde95d276028420",
      "text": "嚼嚼……\n哼，情人节这种东西倒也不坏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_23:5_01_040_23_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6720de3389af1b23f597cc1bf0d92fc48134ace4d20c6a8b038d369b496412ae",
      "text": "喂下仆，还能再来一份的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_23:5_01_040_23_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb30ac309783d0f893bab8f5c7211f120aed40747f221c436a4b11df6b1e6043",
      "text": "你手里有的巧克力，\n全部都要归本大爷享用啦。库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
